    "what": "The baseline capital book. Versioned here in the repository rather than in an external database: no latency, no credentials, no service that can be down during a demonstration, and every change to it is a reviewable commit.",
    "figures": "Invented, but internally consistent. The payments sum to the deployed figure, the commitments to the committed figure, and the phased series sums back to the roll-up. A book whose totals do not reconcile teaches a reader to distrust the screen.",
